        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.2+JER.46.3+JER.46.4+JER.46.5+JER.46.6+JER.46.7+JER.46.8+JER.46.9+JER.46.10+JER.46.11+JER.46.12+JER.46.13+JER.46.14+JER.46.15+JER.46.16+JER.46.17+JER.46.18+JER.46.19+JER.46.20+JER.46.21+JER.46.22+JER.46.23+JER.46.24+JER.46.25+JER.46.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 46:2-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Ezek 29:1—32:32.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo ebigambo ebyarangirweho ensi Misiri. MUKAMA aliija omunsi Misiri, naizira ha kicu ekirukwanguha; abacwezi ba Misiri obu balimubona, balitukumira, abantu boona abalimarwaho, obutiini bulyenda kubaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nditabangura Abantu ba Misiri barwanise Abanyamisiri bagenzi baabo, abantu balirwana, nyineemu erwanisangane, omutaahi arwanise omutaahi, orubuga rurwanise orubuga orundi, obukama burwanise obukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamisiri balihwa amasiko; ndibaburanganiza omu byona ebi barukwenda kukora; baligenda kwekaguzaaho: abacwezi, embandwa, abanyakubandwa emizimu, n'abarogo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati: Abanyamisiri ndibaha omukuru atarukusoboka, ndibaha omukama ataina mbabazi nuwe abaleme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaizi ag'ekisaaru Nairo galyoma; kirihweramu kimu akanyansi, kiburwemu n'otwizi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emikura yakyo, erinuunka, emikono ey'ekisaaru Nairo ekya Misiri erikeehwamu amaizi eyomere kimu, amabingo n'omugugu birijunda bihweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiikaro ebya haihi na Nairo, tibiribamu kantu, ebintu byona ebiriba bisigirwe ha mukungu gwa Nairo, n'omu biikaro ebikiheriire biryomera kimu, birihuuhurwa omuyaga, tibirigaruka kuzooka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasohi b'encu, balirra batemu ekyoboobo, abo boona abanyakunaga irobo omu Nairo, abanyakutega obutimba omu kisaaru eki, balihwa amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakozi abanyakuteera obugoigo n'abo abanyakwongosa engoye eza pamba erukwera, balihwa amasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo abali nk'enyomyo z'ensi, balihwaho, n'abo boona abanyakukolerra empeera balisaalirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeebembezi aba Siyoni, badoma cuu; abahabuzi ba Faraaho eby'amagezi nibamuhabura eby'obudoma. Osobora ota kugamba Faraaho oti: “Nyowe ndi mwana w'abantu ab'amagezi? Nkazaarwa abakama aba ira?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati abantu bawe abanyamagezi abo, baraha? Bakugambire kandi bakumanyise MUKAMA ow'amahe eki yateekaniriize Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeebembezi ba Siyoni bakwasirwe obudoma kandi aba Noofu nibabiihwabiihwa; abo abarukuzooka nk'obugumizo obw'enganda, nubo baahabisize Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA abahaire kuhabura abantu ebirukubahabisa. Ekirugire omuli eki, Misiri byona ebi erukukora neebisobya, kandi neetahukatahuka nk'omutamiizi oku atahukira ha ntanaki ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Busaho muntu n'omu omunsi Misiri, omuguuda rundi omunaku, ow'ekitiinisa, rundi atarukumanywa arukusobora kugira eki akora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, Abanyamisiri baliba nk'abakazi, balitukumira habw'obutiini, nibarora MUKAMA ow'amahe agoroire omukono kubafubira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi ya Yuda, nayo eritiinisa Abanyamisiri, weena ow'aligambirwa, alitiina, habw'ebi MUKAMA ow'amahe ebi yabategekiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasumi ako obu kalihika, omunsi Misiri halibamu embuga itaano eziribaza engambo ey'Abanyakanaani, kandi balirahira MUKAMA ow'amahe. Orumu hali zo, nurwo rulyetwa rubuga rwa Izooba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasumi ako obu kalihika, halibaho itambiro eririkolerwa MUKAMA hagati y'ensi eya Misiri habeho n'enyomyo eyeribyalirwa Mukama ha mutaano gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byombi, nuko kaliba karorwaho kandi bwakaiso bwa MUKAMA ow'amahe, omunsi ya Misiri; abantu ab'omunsi egi, obu baraaterraga MUKAMA enduuru, habw'abo abarukubabonesa, araabatwekeraga omujuni abarwanirre kandi abajune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA alibeemanyisa; kandi omu kasumi ako, balimumanya bamuramye, bamutambire ebyonzira, bamuhongere ebihongwa eby'okwokya, balimuraganiza ebintu kandi babihikirize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA alifubira Abanyamisiri, baitu noobu alibafubira, kandi alibatambira balimukubukira, alibaha eki barukusaba, abatambire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasumi ako obu kalihika, halibaho omuhanda ogurukuruga Misiri nigugenda Asiriya, Abasiriya baraagendaga Misiri, kandi abanyamisiri baragendaga Asiriya. Abanyamisiri n'Abasiriya, baraaramizaga hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasumi ako obu kalihika, Isirairi eringana ekitiinisa, Misiri n'Asiriya, kandi amahanga asatu ago, nugo galihaisa ensi yoona omugisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'obusobozi bwona aligaha omugisa naagamba ati: “Ndibaha omugisa inywe Abanyamisiri, abantu bange; inywe Abasiriya abanahangire, na inywe Abaisirairi abantu bange aba nayegomboize.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
